experiment: framecopy
  instrument        framecopy   trial seed 000000000135dbc9   1200000 ticks
                    another probe is another trial sequence: its numbers
                    are not comparable with these (~0.05 at 300 trials)
  question          `babblerhythm` showed the voice DRONES, so the frame has
                    to come from somewhere. Can the creature catch one from
                    its caregiver?
  the caregiver     says ONE STEADY VOWEL switched on and off. No formant
                    motion at all -- this is FRAME, not content, and it
                    exercises the tau 60 ms glottal path rather than the
                    tau 800 ms formant path.
  the three arms    `silent` drones. `oracle` injects the rhythm straight
                    into vocal groups 1 and 8, bypassing the brain, and so
                    measures THE CHAIN'S CEILING. `heard` makes the brain do
                    the work.
  why the oracle    a flat `heard` ALONE cannot tell "the brain cannot lock"
                    from "the chain cannot carry", and those have different
                    next steps.

  THE STATISTIC, designed against the failure that killed `babblerhythm`
    that run fitted a 1/f trend across two decades and read the residual,
    which planted a spurious peak at the filter's knee. Here the drive
    frequency is KNOWN, so this is a LOCAL SNR: power at f over the mean of
    side-bands at 0.60-0.85f and 1.15-1.40f. Both sit on the same part of the
    1/f curve, the slope cancels, and NO trend is fitted. A drone reads ~1.0.

  PRE-REGISTERED
    null      `silent` must read SNR ~1.0. If it does not, the statistic is
              picking up something structural and nothing else can be read.
    ceiling   `oracle` says how far the CHAIN carries a frame. I calculated
              ~2.7 Hz from tau 60 ms; this MEASURES it, including the voicing
              threshold's hysteresis and the renderer, which the formula
              ignores.
    entrained `heard` SNR >= 2.0 and >= 3 SE over `silent`, at any f.
    MEANINGLESS if `heard` merely reproduces `oracle`'s transfer curve --
              same shape, same rolloff. That would be the FILTER again, not
              the brain. Entrainment must look DIFFERENT from injection.

